  - if `assignments` is non-empty and `max(assignments.values()) != shard_count`, ignore the map and delegate to `select_shard_indices` (full index round-robin safety net).
  - otherwise, for each index `i` with `nodeid = nodeids[i]`:
    - when `nodeid` is in `assignments`, keep iff `assignments[nodeid] == shard_id`.
    - when `nodeid` is **not** in `assignments`, keep iff `(i % shard_count) + 1 == shard_id` (same rule as `select_shard_indices`).
